libRocket provides CMake import targets:

    find_package(libRocket CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main
      PRIVATE
      RocketCore
      RocketControls
      RocketDebugger
    )

The import targets carry the include search path, so no additional
include_directories() call is required. The config also sets the include
search path variable:

    libRocket_INCLUDE_DIRS
